# Research pipeline output (regenerable via fetch_all_symbols.py + run_research_all.py;
# large — one observations.csv alone is ~224MB, plus 100-shuffle permutation-test folders
# (one pair's permutation_test/ subfolder alone is ~2.4GB, walk_forward/ ~116MB)
data/

# claude code changed: was a blanket `research_data/` exclusion. Carved out a
# narrow exception for the small set of files bot/views/pairs_performance_data.py
# and research_lab_data.py actually read (367KB total, vs. gigabytes for the rest)
# — the Pairs Performance page was deployed to Railway with no data to show
# because none of research_data/ ever reached git. Every un-ignored directory
# below is immediately re-excluded one level down (`dir/*` after `!dir/`) so
# only the named files escape — NOT the multi-GB shuffle folders / OOS trade
# logs that live alongside them.
research_data/*
